        "content": "<p>probably mine is less well thought out than the above blog post, but i have a rough formalisation of kripke models for propositional logic in <a href=\"https://github.com/thomaskwaring/cslib_SKI/blob/kripke/Cslib/Logics/Propositional/Semantics/Kripke.lean\">my cslib branch</a> if you are interested :)</p>",
