    {
        "content": "<p>We have adopted an approach that separates Kripke frames from valuations. This <a href=\"https://github.com/FormalizedFormalLogic/Foundation/blob/master/Foundation/Propositional/Kripke/Basic.lean\">code</a> for the intuitionistic propositional logic might be helpful. </p>\n<p><span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"543250\">@SnO2WMaN</span> might be able to explain this in more detail.</p>",
